Agulater third-party notices
=============================

This file applies to the Agulater standalone executables and to the optional
npm compatibility package. It was reviewed against Bun 1.4.0 and bun.lock for
Agulater 0.2.1-rc.1.

The standalone executable is produced with `bun build --compile`. Bun's
documentation states that this embeds both the application bundle and a copy
of the Bun runtime. The npm compatibility package does not embed Bun; Bun is
its declared runtime.

